window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Legends are made, not born, and I carved mine on ice...</b></p> <p>They call me The Hitman. The NHL's dirtiest player. The ender of careers.</p> <p>On the ice, I'm unapologetically ruthless. Off the ice, I'm worse.</p> <p>All it takes is one pissed-off message from a stunningly beautiful fan after a brutal game and I'm knocked off balance.</p> <p>Suddenly, I'm stalking. Watching. Obsessed.</p> <p>Cassidy thinks she knows danger? She hasn't met me yet.</p> <p>Her ties to Roman Morozov, my on-ice nemesis, only heighten the thrill of the chase. Stealing his girl is just the beginning.</p> <p>When our worlds collide at her bar, she issues a challenge that I can't refuse: One game to score a hat trick. When I do it, she'll be mine. She's my prize—my fixation.</p> <p>I'll make her mine, even if it means embracing a new level of darkness. There's nothing I won't do to keep her... and when she finds out what I've done, she'll realize that she's in deeper than she ever imagined.</p> <p>Dirty Hit <i>is a dark hockey stalker romance with a long list of content warnings. This series features lots of dirty hockey players willing to sell their souls to win.</i></p>"; 
